    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rebuild a city for Mellings! Launch missions across different regions and bring resources and survivors home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/23072fba664c9f88f41655f030f83be9.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an excavator, use various cannons to defend yourself against the hordes of enemies that will try to repel you... and also destroy buildings with larger-caliber equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/ebe418f4f0ed091bac1b290c6c920b34.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the excavator's enormous claws to harvest resources on the ground. Aim carefully and try to obtain the rarest resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/e49dec9c804468738a96c813ab570dc6.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rebuild a city for Mellings! Launch missions across different regions and bring resources and survivors home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/23072fba664c9f88f41655f030f83be9.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an excavator, use various cannons to defend yourself against the hordes of enemies that will try to repel you... and also destroy buildings with larger-caliber equipment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/ebe418f4f0ed091bac1b290c6c920b34.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the excavator's enormous claws to harvest resources on the ground. Aim carefully and try to obtain the rarest resources!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/e49dec9c804468738a96c813ab570dc6.avif?t=1750064891\" width=422 height=294 /></span></p>",
